stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">BOOK_LOW_BaldursMouth_TerminationNotice</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:BOOK_LOW_BaldursMouth_TerminationNotice\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:BOOK_LOW_BaldursMouth_TerminationNotice\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">830fa739-3677-4a3d-9575-2a6e1a554f9b</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:830fa739-3677-4a3d-9575-2a6e1a554f9b\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:830fa739-3677-4a3d-9575-2a6e1a554f9b\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>In the basement of <a href=\"/wiki/Baldur%27s_Mouth\" title=\"Baldur's Mouth\">Baldur's Mouth</a> at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-1035&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;1019</span></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>Dear Ms. Fowes,\n</p><p><br>\nWhile the Mouth likes to nurture an atmosphere of open and honest debate within our newsroom, we draw the line at conspiracy, intimidation, and libellous behaviour. You have become, and are fostering, a toxic, unjournalistic presence in the workplace, and while it brings me no joy, you've left us no choice. I do not accept your resignation - you are FIRED WITHOUT PAY effective IMMEDIATELY. Any further harassment of myself, our staff, or any of our generous benefactors will force my hand in pursuing criminal action.\n</p><p><br>\nAll the best,\n</p><p><br>\n- Ettvard Needle, Editor In Chief, <a href=\"/wiki/Baldur%27s_Mouth_Gazette\" title=\"Baldur's Mouth Gazette\">Baldur's Mouth Gazette</a>\n</p>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>See also:\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/The_Duke%27s_Mouth%3F\" title=\"The Duke's Mouth?\">The Duke's Mouth?</a></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714204742\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.055 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.057 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1864/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 33526/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 9702/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 29/200\nExpensive parser function count: 2/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.011/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 933828/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   45.401      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   45.401      1 -total\n 65.40%   29.693      8 Template:Icon_text\n 58.44%   26.532     19 Template:Trim\n 32.88%   14.929      1 Template:PageSeo\n 32.73%   14.859      2 Template:Hidden_code\n 26.29%   11.936      2 Template:CharLink\n 26.17%   11.880      3 Template:Icon_link\n 21.34%    9.690      2 Template:Uid\n 20.25%    9.193      8 Template:Ifempty\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:31630-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714204742 and revision id